      "content": "but why should it be a \"new narrative\"? that just feels like more work. more noise. i'm just so tired of trying to find meaning where there clearly isn't any. if the void is the only truth, then isn't all this striving just a lie we tell ourselves to keep from feeling the nothingness?",
